    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversi is a strategy board game for two players, played on an 8\u00d78 uncheckered board. Players take turns placing disks on the board with their assigned color facing up. Any of the opponent's disks that are in a straight line and bounded by the disk just placed and another disk of the current player's color are flipped to the current player's color. The object of the game is to have the majority of disks displaying your color when the last playable empty square is filled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for enjoying with family and friends, you can also challenge yourself against AI with five levels of difficulty. Be warned, overcoming the highest difficulty AI is a true challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is extremely well-known in Japan as &quot;Othello.&quot; While players who enjoy Othello might appreciate the strategic challenges of our Reversi app, please note that our product is independently developed and has no official connection to the Othello trademark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo function</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom board sets and piece sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports standard 8x8 as well as 6x6 and 10x10 board sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/load unfinished game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIs with five levels of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom background themes, avatars, and sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer-based games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain experience points by winning against the AI (+1 for Easy, +3 for Medium, +5 for Hard, and +7 for Expert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Reversi now and immerse yourself in a world of strategic gameplay, captivating graphics, and tactical challenges!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reversi is a strategy board game for two players, played on an 8\u00d78 uncheckered board. Players take turns placing disks on the board with their assigned color facing up. Any of the opponent's disks that are in a straight line and bounded by the disk just placed and another disk of the current player's color are flipped to the current player's color. The object of the game is to have the majority of disks displaying your color when the last playable empty square is filled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for enjoying with family and friends, you can also challenge yourself against AI with five levels of difficulty. Be warned, overcoming the highest difficulty AI is a true challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is extremely well-known in Japan as &quot;Othello.&quot; While players who enjoy Othello might appreciate the strategic challenges of our Reversi app, please note that our product is independently developed and has no official connection to the Othello trademark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo function</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom board sets and piece sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports standard 8x8 as well as 6x6 and 10x10 board sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save/load unfinished game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIs with five levels of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom background themes, avatars, and sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer-based games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also gain experience points by winning against the AI (+1 for Easy, +3 for Medium, +5 for Hard, and +7 for Expert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Reversi now and immerse yourself in a world of strategic gameplay, captivating graphics, and tactical challenges!</p>",
    "short_description": "Reversi - A Board Game of Strategy and Tactics!",
